---
title: Brownies
author: Aunt Vera McFall
category: Cookies
cook time: 20 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@shortening{0.5%cup}
@chocolate{2%squares}
@eggs{3}
@flour{0.75%cup}
@baking powder{0.5%tsp}
@walnuts{1%cup}
@salt{1%tsp}
@vanilla{1%tsp}
@chocolate frosting

Melt shortening and chocolate on low heat. Cool. Add eggs (one-at-a-time), flour, baking powder, walnuts, salt, and vanilla. Bake at 350 degrees in a greased 8x8 pan for about 20 minutes. Check with toothpick. Can be frosted with chocolate frosting.
